    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. We encourage you to review this policy occasionally to stay informed about how we are protecting the information we collect.</p>

    <h2>7. Contact Us</h2>

    <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at pa-tech@gmail.com.</p>
</section>

